<Layout title="About | Francis Gian Juson">
  <div class="prose prose-sm md:prose-base">
    <h1 class="text-black dark:text-white font-serif">About Me</h1>
    <p>Hey I'm Francis.</p>
    <p>
      I'm currently an undergraduate student at AMA University and an Web
      Developer Intern at Holocron Tracker Trading. I <span class="font-bold">
        focus on building applications using React and Next.js
      </span>. In addition, I have experience developing websites using Astro -
      in fact, this very website was built with Astro.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <p>
      I'm passionate about many things like listening to music, playing video
      games, and of course coding. I'm also passionate about the development of
      new technologies and this combination of interests is what ultimately led
      me to pursue a career in coding, with the goal of making a significant
      impact in the world of technology and helping to shape its future.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
